  "details": "This has been a issue the past 2-3 builds, so I thought it best to report it as its extremely annoying while working on my AI software as it makes it hard to service for long without constantly rejoining, seems this issue causes vrchat as a whole to slowly stop functioning to differing degrees.\n\nHOW TO REPRODUCE:\n\n* Open VRCHAT\n\n* Play normally\n\n* Play for a extended time (could be hours?), maybe have your internet connection be unstable for a while (not confirmed if thats a possible reason but a theory)?\n\nPOTENTIAL EFFECTS:\n\n* Microphone will completely fail and others wont be able to hear you., might need to be reinitialized for other players, might not even fix for some users.\n\n* Jittery player model movements\n\n* Jittery voice\n\n* OSC can start to fail to work.\n\n* Sometimes causes disconnect errors, or EAC servers freaking out.\n\nSometimes the server will slowly start having all players lag around, they will also have their voice become jittery and break, rejoining temporarily fixes the issue but it will slowly return.\n\nMore information about its oddities and weirdness here: https://twitter.com/REOPERATORR/status/1834979140895654153",
